{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7657123725535889705","title":"传感器工程师（AG）-2027校招","description":"1、负责产品上IMU、指南针、气压计等传感器的校准算法；\n2、负责产品上IMU、指南针、气压计、GPS、RTK等传感器的故障诊断及隔离、冗余系统的仲裁等算法；\n3、解决产品研发过程中的传感器性能问题，保证传感器性能的一致性；\n4、负责产品上传感器的性能验收，建设性能评估体系建设，以及约束耦合模块的设计；\n5、解决传感器在生产中的良率问题。","requirement":"1、硕士及以上学历，计算机、自动化、通信、电子、精密仪器等专业优先；\n2、了解MEMS IMU、指南针和气压计的基本工作原理、性能指标、常见失效模式、误差模型及标定算法；\n3、了解数字信号处理，有过IIR/FIR滤波器设计经验优先，参与过姿态解算算法的开发或调优；\n4、了解GPS和RTK的基本原理，掌握其关键评价指标，有实际工程应用经验；\n5、掌握C/C++语言，熟悉python；\n6、沟通能力和执行能力强，严谨细致，有技术追求和产品热情。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1782813252131,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7657123725535742249","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}